POST http://localhost:5290/api/OrgMember
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "d06303c3-af8c-445f-9faf-b61e58939e95",
  "userId": "3a6b0418-1639-42a0-a4a9-42ee3d5cdb99",
  "role": "member"
}

### Change an organization member's role
PUT http://localhost:5290/api/OrgMember/7a6a9018-4761-4f00-914c-1e11f27d6c80
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "owner"
}

### Remove an organization member
DELETE http://localhost:5290/api/OrgMember/7a6a9018-4761-4f00-914c-1e11f27d6c80


### Get all organization invitations
GET http://localhost:5290/api/OrgInvitation

