Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "d06303c3-af8c-445f-9faf-b61e58939e95",
  "email": "member@example.com",
  "role": "member",
  "token": "3ec4e5a3ac60a4ed7bbfb6c23d99631dd350a6ab8635689e6a4b75c7ac92bb18",
  "invitedBy": "3a6b0418-1639-42a0-a4a9-42ee3d5cdb99",
  "expiresAt": "2026-10-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### Update an organization invitation
PUT http://localhost:5290/api/OrgInvitation/7a6a9018-4761-4f00-914c-1e11f27d6c80
Content-Type: application/json

